<title>USA: Buckeye raises and extends offer for Merfin.</title>
<headline>Buckeye raises and extends offer for Merfin.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buckeye Cellulose said Wednesday it is raising its offer for Merfin International Inc to C$6.50 a share and extending the offer through May 8 in response to Merfin's decision earlier Wednesday to waive its poison pill on or before May 8.</p>
<p>Buckeye, which makes cellulose pulps, had originally offered Cdn $6 a share to acquire Merfin, which makes and markets air-laid materials.</p>
</text>
